flowchart LR
  C[Fresh console output] --> X[Evidence reconciliation]
  G[Stored known-good configuration] --> X
  T[Current telemetry and topology] --> X
  S[Timestamped imported telemetry fallback] --> X
  M[Maintained asset building assignment] --> X
  T -. building conflict only .-> M
  UI[Authorized inventory or node edit] --> SYNC[Transactional assignment sync and audit]
  SYNC --> M
  DEL[Confirmed asset retirement] --> AUDIT[Deletion audit; configs preserved]
  X --> L[Local access port and VLAN]
  L --> U[Local uplink and LAG]
  U --> R[Reciprocal upstream port]
  R --> D[Downstream dependencies]
  D --> I[Independent service signal]
  I --> O[Fault domain and confidence]
  O --> A[Test, fix, validation, rollback]

  BG[Background or near-live observation] --> RO[Read-only tool allow-list]
  RO --> X
  RO -. blocked .-> W[Tasks, memory, inventory, and other writes]
